  ],
  "description": "Open a second Database db2 on the same file read-write. For each of (Options 0, LockEdits default, row 2), (dbSeeChanges 512, default, row 3), (0, dbOptimistic 3, row 4), (512, 3, row 5): dynaset A over F with the Options and LockEdits arguments, Move to the row, hold N, read N; db2.Execute UPDATE F SET N = 900 + ID WHERE ID = row (dbFailOnError); A Edit, Errors, EditMode, read N; assign N 5; Update; Errors; EditMode; Move 0; read N; close A. Asks whether Edit or Update detects a change made through another Database, whether dbSeeChanges and the lock mode alter it, and the stored value afterwards. The fixture copy is opened read-write.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
